   "stem": {
      "text": "For every nonzero constant \\( C \\), the function \\( y = C e^{kx} \\) is a solution of the differential equation \\( y'' + y' - 6y = 0 \\), and \\( y \\to 0 \\) as \\( x \\to \\infty \\). Find the value of the constant \\( k \\)."
