         "step": 3,
         "text": "Since \\( e^{kx} \\neq 0 \\), \\( k^{2} + k - 6 = 0 \\), so \\( k = -3 \\) or \\( k = 2 \\).",
         "mathjson": 2
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "Since \\( y \\to 0 \\) as \\( x \\to \\infty \\), \\( k < 0 \\), so \\( k = -3 \\).",
